[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 3: wide roll-off, wide spectrum.
# Roll-off 1.0 uses twice the minimum bandwidth. Open the Spectrum tab and
# compare with 03b (roll-off 0.2): the skirts are broader but the eye is more forgiving.
